{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 150,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I started coding when I was 12"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3150,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I very rapidly got\nkind of obsessed with it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6480,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that came from the\nfeeling of being able"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9240,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to build without barriers,\nwhich I think is one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12000,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the special things about programming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14310,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With coding, you just need a computer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16440,
    "dDurationMs": 4321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can build things that\nyou dream up in your mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20761,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bright music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26160,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cursor is a tool"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27450,
    "dDurationMs": 3063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that helps professionals\nbuild software faster with AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32220,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means being the best place to work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33810,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with coding agents, both\nfor professional engineers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37539,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and folks with no engineering\nbackground at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40260,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's both giving people\na tool that's approachable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42270,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then is also really powerful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44904,
    "dDurationMs": 3516,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bright music continues)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48420,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Anthropic and Cursor\nhave a tight relationship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51210,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How would you describe it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52470,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- One of the things we really\nappreciated about Anthropic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55560,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is how committed the\ncompany is to principles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58500,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which has been one of kind of\nthe core founding components"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62310,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or missions of the company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63510,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think it extends also\nto how you all serve customers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66330,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think from the start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68430,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the company there's been a commitment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69600,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to really being a platform\nand being something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72120,
    "dDurationMs": 2976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that folks can build lasting\nbusinesses on top of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75096,
    "dDurationMs": 1914,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77010,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been a deep partnership and one we're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78840,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really grateful for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80160,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I actually remember we were a very,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82200,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very scrappy team back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83790,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anthropic was a more scrappy organization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85740,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than it is now too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86790,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think that part\nof what's enabled Cursor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88860,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to exist is just like this\nrevolution in AI models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92880,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's been this great\nproductive tight alignment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95520,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between some of the stuff\nwe're doing on the product side"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97170,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of things and some of\nthe increases in modeling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99090,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "capabilities that you all are working on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101130,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What differentiates Cursor?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102210,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think there's a deep\nproduct focus at the company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104670,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From the very start we want\nto give folks more autonomy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108120,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and help them be more empowered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109860,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that this is like a great time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111210,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be working on a company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112620,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's because I think in short\norder, like a whole new set"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115980,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of companies have been made possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118170,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that have like different physics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120540,
    "dDurationMs": 1677,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like different business physics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122217,
    "dDurationMs": 1113,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bright music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123330,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two years ago we were 15 people in a room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125130,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now we're 700 people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126900,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and serve over 60% of the Fortune 500"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129330,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you know, have very\nlarge software business that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132450,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, rivals many of the biggest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134640,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "public software companies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135870,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's definitely kind of crazy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138030,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's not lost on us\njust how special this is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142680,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how unprecedented it is, historically,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147420,
    "dDurationMs": 3885,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and feel lucky to be able to\ncontribute in some way to this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151305,
    "dDurationMs": 3417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(bright music continues)"
    } ]
  } ]
}
